From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 1ma <hello@1ma.ai>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 08:36:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] 1ma: the server updates itself from 1ma's GitHub releases

bb's in-app update installs bb-app@<version> from npm, which would replace
1ma with bb. The server now reads the newest version from
server-version.json in 1ma's desktop-latest release and installs that
version's 1ma-server-<version>.tgz from its desktop/v<version> release,
after checking it against the release's SHA256SUMS. ONEMA_UPDATE_COMMAND_PREFIX
can wrap the npm install, for hosts that run installs under a resource limit.
